WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:02.670
What's that?

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.320
What in the world...

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.290
Take a look, viewers!

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:13.960
A giant creature has appeared out of nowhere!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.900
Just what in the world is going on?

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.910
Congratulations on your resurrection, King Selfish.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:26.040
We have all been long awaiting this day.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.110
Talk about a brown-noser.

00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:29.510
Gag me.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:35.990
We shall conquer the human world and strike down all who oppose!

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.080
Very well.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:42.160
Today shall be the day those meddlesome Precures meet their doom.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:43.460
Any objections,

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:45.560
Princess Regina?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:47.960
Of course not. Now go!

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:49.000
Right!

00:00:51.370 --> 00:00:52.890
Tryin' to fool yourself?

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.410
About what?

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:55.430
I wonder.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.480
I've chosen to live for Daddy's sake.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.140
Well, that's fine.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:03.040
But...

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.850
that glum psyche of yours is an eyesore.

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.950
This is a catastrophe!

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.620
Everyone in the area, evacuate ASAP!

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:27.000
Huh?

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:29.140
Who are <i>they</i>?

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:36.550
All right, girls.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:38.310
Let's go!

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:40.020
{OP}

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:46.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:51.550
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.590
Every day it sparkles

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:57.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:04.180
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:09.840
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:15.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:20.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:26.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:35.490
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:37.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.580
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:42.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:45.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.080
is our promise between girls

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:55.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:55.150 --> 00:03:01.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:13.040
Cure Heart's Determination!

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:13.040
Cure Heart's Determination!

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.530
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:15.500
Ace Shot!

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:17.190
Bang!

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:21.310
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.950
Let's focus on getting to King Selfish!

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:29.180
Yes. We need to make him stop, quick!

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:32.010
That said, it doesn't look easy...

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:35.030
Complaints won't get us anywhere.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:36.160
You're right.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:39.400
Precure Diamond Swirkle!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:44.710
This is not a movie!

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:46.850
This is real, live coverage!

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:54.180
A giant creature has arisen from the sea and five girls are desperately fighting to stop it!

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:57.460
We don't know who these girls are,

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.790
but we can say this:

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:05.630
these girls are risking their lives to protect us and the entire world!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.290
Teacher, we've gotta evacuate now!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:11.150
I was thinking the same thing.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.300
Hey, look!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.130
It's Cure Heart!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.810
She's always protected us before...

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.770
but who is she really?

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:23.600
There's no end to them.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:24.620
No kidding.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.730
Bel!

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.580
Hey there, Precures.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.910
Today marks the end of our miserable acquaint—

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:35.520
Sword!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.200
I'll handle him!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.360
Go on ahead!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.940
You truly think you can stop me alone?

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:42.790
No.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:47.040
She's not alone!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.040
Rosetta!

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.370
Our hearts are all one!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.290
Now hurry!

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.200
Thanks!

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.910
<i>That</i> was pathetic.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:59.010
You sure you can beat them?

00:04:59.010 --> 00:05:00.610
I don't need to!

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:01.280
Huh?

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:03.900
They'll destroy themselves.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:09.260
Indeed, because they cling to their foolish delusion of love.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.900
Now, sparkle!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.620
Twinkle Diamond!

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.880
<i>I'll</i> be the one to defeat the Precures.

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:28.350
Ira...

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:32.850
You did this last time, too.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:34.870
Don't remember it.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.400
Oh, what a shame.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.670
You've got no chance now that King Selfish is resurrected.

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:44.190
So, what're you fighting for?

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:46.030
It may be difficult,

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:48.630
but we can't give up.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.730
I see.

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:52.350
Then—

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:59.780
I'll defeat you here, Cure Diamond!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:05.480
You can try, but you can't defeat me.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:08.350
What? What do you mean?

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:11.320
Well, in case you didn't know,

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.060
diamonds...

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:15.920
are unbreakable! {Alt: "Diamond... is not crash!"}

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:23.050
You brats just don't know when to quit.

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:26.140
What can you possibly do against these odds?

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.960
I know not.

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:32.390
But if we all keep trying, we'll certainly find a way!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:34.340
So I feel!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:37.050
You "feel"? That's it?

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.610
That's all we need!

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:44.120
That's how rigid our bonds are!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.520
What a joke!

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:47.750
That's not all!

00:06:49.110 --> 00:06:52.570
I stand here more rigid than ever!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.170
C'mon, Cure Sword.

00:06:58.170 --> 00:07:00.600
You won't cut me like that.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.330
I'm not trying to cut you!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.480
What?!

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:07.900
To sever is cowardice, but cutting forth leads to the future!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.850
I am the blade of courage that pierces the heart!

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:14.320
That is why the princess gave me my name:

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.020
Cure Sword!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.680
Your blade is dull!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.170
Girls...

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:22.770
Heart!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.060
Regina...

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.520
Mana, why do you still persist...

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.800
when I can't even stand to see your face anymore?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.050
Because we made a promise.

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:45.120
Huh?

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:50.020
I said we'd meet your dad once you felt better, remember?

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.500
My plans got a bit off track,

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.130
but now's the time to follow through.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:05.110
Mr. King Selfiiiiiiiiiiish!

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:10.390
Please listen to meeeeeeee!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:17.440
Be silent!

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:24.070
Begone from my presence!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.470
You see that?

00:08:44.470 --> 00:08:48.000
Your words will never reach Daddy.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:52.740
I... won't give up!

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.020
What?!

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:05.390
Take a moment... and listen... to what others say!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:11.070
All we want to do... is to protect... everyone's smiles!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.220
Protect?

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:16.540
What can you hope to protect with your feeble power?

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.830
Everything!

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:22.420
Both this world and Trump Kingdom...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.110
Both Regina's smile and yours...

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:29.740
We'll protect it all!

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:36.220
Whoah, they pushed him back!

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.940
But it's too late for theatrics.

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.470
What do you mean?

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.720
This world's done for.

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:47.170
I'm sure you already know...

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:50.780
of the day Trump Kingdom fell.

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:58.430
The once peaceful, neighborly citizens...

00:09:58.430 --> 00:10:01.020
suddenly twisted in fear.

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.870
Move it! I'm goin' first!

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:06.920
Shut it! You're in my way!

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.000
The hell was that for?!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.370
Help me!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:16.850
They thought only of saving themselves, performed despicable acts,

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:19.320
and became Selfishes on their own.

00:10:20.060 --> 00:10:21.340
And now,

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:25.630
the people of this world are acting just as those in Trump Kingdom once did.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:32.310
Just like Trump Kingdom, this entire world shall lose its love!

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.990
No, it won't.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.190
What?

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:41.950
I believe that love is undefeatable.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.730
I'm sure that even now...

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.700
people are supporting each other with love!

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.730
You think people that foolish exist?

00:10:51.050 --> 00:10:52.330
They exist.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.220
I can feel it.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:58.910
Their love is like a racing heart!

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:02.950
Move it! I'm goin' first!

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.340
You're in the way!

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.170
Excuse me!

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:10.610
Could someone lend a hand?

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:15.350
There are injured people who can't move!

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:17.860
Please, someone help us!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:19.670
Hey, where are they?

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:22.370
If we don't hurry, we won't make it!

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:25.040
It's you guys! Thank you so much!

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:26.540
Lead the way.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:27.250
Sure!

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:29.930
I'll help too!

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:31.070
I will, too.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.060
Thank you!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:37.420
We gotta help each other when we're down!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.240
Yeah!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.310
O{*\c&H6C5B50&}o{*\c&H766052&}g{*\c&H806553&}a{*\c&H8A6A55&}i U{*\c&H987157&}n{*\c&H926E56&}i{*\c&H8D6B55&}v{*\c&H876854&}e{*\c&H826553&}r{*\c&H7C6252&}s{*\c&H775F51&}i{*\c&H715C50&}ty {*\c&H69574E&}H{*\c&H68554D&}o{*\c&H67544C&}s{*\c&H66524B&}p{*\c&H65514A&}i{*\c&H644F49&}t{*\c&H634E48&}al

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.310
Oogai University Hospital

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.310
You'll be fine.

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:43.920
Someone will come to help.

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:46.620
Thank you so much for your help.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:47.080
Oh.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.170
Don't worry about it.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.510
Desperate times, and all.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.660
Apologies for the wait!

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:58.750
We'll begin transportation of those needing aid!

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:07.810
I, Itsutsuboshi Reina, shall humbly assist however I can!

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:15.440
Can't you hear the heartbeats of love?

00:12:27.500 --> 00:12:29.380
I can feel it...

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:32.710
Caring for others carries such a gentle tone...

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:36.450
A gentle tone that never gives up hope...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.830
It resounds ever further as people help each other...

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:44.710
It creates a harmony!

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:49.490
Foolishness!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:55.820
I'll just destroy your precious heartbeat of love!

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.210
Rosetta!

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.160
I can't...

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.740
hold it back!

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:23.110
The Clover Tower!

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:50.260
It's not over.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:54.150
The heartbeat of love isn't gone!

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:56.230
Good point.

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.860
It wouldn't do to give up here.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.420
You insolent pests!

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:07.900
You dare resist in the wake of my overwhelming power?

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.740
Are you too daft to know fear?

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.370
We have nothing to fear!

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:16.170
Yes. The Eternal Golden Crown showed us the truth.

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:19.570
You are Regina's father!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:27.750
That's why I know you'll be able to see eye to eye!

00:14:28.190 --> 00:14:29.380
That's enough.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:33.900
If you insist on getting in Daddy's way,

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:36.300
I'll fight you!

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:40.660
Heart!

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:41.760
Stay back!

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:47.160
Better watch your backs!

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.700
Don't tell me you forgot about us.

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.960
Stop this, Regina!

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:01.680
Regina!

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:26.570
What, are you done?

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:32.830
After all you've been through, do you still think you can talk with Daddy or me?

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:36.320
Why won't you fight back?!

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:41.290
I won't fight you, Regina.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:42.990
Why?!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.690
Because we're friends.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:52.040
I can't break a promise to a friend.

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:55.440
Get a grip!

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:58.610
That promise lost all meaning long ago!

00:15:58.610 --> 00:16:01.380
We're not friends any...

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:02.880
We're friends.

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:08.880
Come on, Regina. Stop hurting yourself.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:12.320
I-I'm not hurt...

00:16:12.710 --> 00:16:15.520
Regina, you were crying.

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:21.590
And those weren't tears of joy.

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:26.060
I saw tears filled with the pain of having nowhere to belong.

00:16:28.890 --> 00:16:31.740
Don't you see?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:37.010
I don't want you to shed those tears.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.690
Why? Why?

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:41.850
What are you after?

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:46.240
You're not my family or anything!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.040
You're a stranger!

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:51.770
I just like you.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:55.460
I just like you, Regina.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:59.540
Do I need anything more?

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:04.110
I like you, Regina,

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:07.430
so I'm sure I can like the Daddy you adore.

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:11.060
I want to like him and understand him!

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:16.640
So, can we talk again, Regina?

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:21.310
Just you, me, and your dad.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:38.280
Be silent!

00:17:38.710 --> 00:17:41.750
Do not lend such nonsense your ear!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:44.110
Regina!

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:44.950
Daddy!

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:51.180
Do not lead Regina astray!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:52.290
That's...

00:17:52.650 --> 00:17:54.190
It's the same beam from before!

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.140
Oh no!

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:56.760
If he fires another one...

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:06.190
Nooooooooo!

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:19.510
The spear...

00:18:25.670 --> 00:18:27.730
Why, Regina?!

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:29.990
Why do you strike back?!

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:35.300
Could it be that <i>love</i> has sprouted in your heart once more?!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.610
Regina!

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:38.390
Daddy...

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:42.650
No, it hasn't. Not in that way.

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:44.280
Love...

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:49.840
has been in my heart from the beginning, Daddy.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:53.520
After all, I love you.

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:56.770
But, you know...

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:01.020
I like Mana too!

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.580
Just as much as you!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.890
I can't choose between you!

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:06.680
I like Mana!

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:08.920
Regina...

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.190
What the heck?

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:14.350
In a way, it's the ultimate selfishness.

00:19:14.350 --> 00:19:15.440
Maybe,

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.400
but her psyche...

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:20.880
is back to its peachy, perky self.

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:24.120
Is that so wrong?

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.270
I don't believe it is.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:31.280
I love Mana too,

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:38.470
but I also love Rikka, Makoto, Aguri, and you!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:39.420
Me too.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:43.220
I used to care only about the princess,

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:47.540
but now I love everyone here.

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:49.860
Silence!

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:54.500
Regina, I am all you need!

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:57.490
I understand how you feel.

00:19:57.490 --> 00:20:01.290
I remember having those same emotions.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.480
But...

00:20:02.990 --> 00:20:09.920
it's best to let the people you love love others instead of hogging them to yourself.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:13.400
You get to know more people that way.

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:16.100
What's wrong with that?

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:23.600
Silence, silence, silence!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.580
Please stop this.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:30.540
The bonds between people are love!

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:35.870
My duty as a warrior of love was not to defeat you,

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.050
but to love!

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:39.960
I've finally realized that.

00:20:40.610 --> 00:20:41.520
And now...

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:44.170
I can do just that.

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:45.490
Because...

00:20:46.020 --> 00:20:49.530
you are my father!

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:55.580
Ann...

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:05.810
Now please, open your eyes!

00:21:06.110 --> 00:21:07.010
Father!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:07.980
Daddy!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.340
Ann...

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:12.960
Regina...

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.660
What could this be?

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:24.900
What could it be that boils within my chest?

00:21:25.190 --> 00:21:28.970
Have you figured it out, King Selfish?

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.870
No, have you remembered?

00:21:32.380 --> 00:21:33.340
It's...

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:34.540
It's...

00:21:34.830 --> 00:21:36.010
It's...

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:38.850
Love.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:44.880
What?!

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.550
I refuse...

00:21:46.550 --> 00:21:48.450
I need no love!

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:50.760
Love does not exist!

00:21:50.760 --> 00:21:56.330
Love shall disappear!

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:05.040
{ED}

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:27.860
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.530
Hearts Racing at Max Speed!

00:22:27.860 --> 00:22:31.530
Hearts Racing at Max Speed!

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:33.430
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
